# CMU's military vehicles: names of the pre-armed tanks an admin can spawn, their loadout parts and the electrolaser crate.

ent-WFVehicleTankTWEArmed = FV150 Hobelar LCT (armed)
    .desc = The FV150 Hobelar with an L26A2 autocannon in its turret, an L98 hull machine gun and an L-39T smoke discharger on its support mount.
ent-WFVehicleTankTurretTWEArmed = Improper TBA3 'Vandeleur' Turret (armed)
    .desc = A Vandeleur turret with an L26A2 autocannon.

ent-WFVehicleTankPMCArmed = M34A2 Longstreet 'Yutani' (armed)
    .desc = The Longstreet with an LTB cannon and an RE700 cupola on its turret and a smoke launcher on its support mount.
ent-WFVehicleTankTurretPMCArmed = tank turret (armed, PMC)
    .desc = A Longstreet tank turret with an LTB cannon and an RE700 cupola.

ent-WFVehicleAmmoBoxElectrolaser = electrolaser power bank crate
    .desc = Power banks for heavy electrolasers.
